WEBVTT

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:04.810
<i>Independent Mixed Test Unit</i>

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:03.360
They're gonna get behind us, Gripen!

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:04.810
I know!

00:02:09.990 --> 00:02:11.560
Kei, are you okay?

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:13.820
Don't worry about me. Concentrate!

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:14.680
But...

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:15.830
I'm begging you...

00:02:15.830 --> 00:02:18.070
Don't let me slow you down!

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:20.260
All right.

00:02:23.410 --> 00:02:24.750
You're kidding me.

00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:34.850
<i>I won!</i>

00:02:34.850 --> 00:02:37.620
<i>Eagle wins again!</i>

00:02:38.140 --> 00:02:40.350
My winning streak continues!

00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:42.570
We lost, huh?

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:47.020
Barbie 01, RTB.

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:53.870
Hey, hey, hey!

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:55.270
I'm really strong, right?

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:56.640
Incredible, right?

00:02:56.640 --> 00:02:59.170
Yeah, you totally beat us.

00:03:02.670 --> 00:03:06.370
Hey, you think I'm amazing too, right?

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:07.420
Not really.

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:13.830
That last battle was just luck, then!

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:20.200
A lightweight fighter like you 
can't possibly do better than me!

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:23.740
But you couldn't protect 
the town on your own.

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:27.000
Hey!

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:29.440
You just lost to me!

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:31.800
Knock it off, you two!

00:03:40.540 --> 00:03:41.850
It's frustrating.

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:46.840
When she says what you and I 
worked hard to do was just luck...

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:52.870
I'm sorry.

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:56.350
Next time, let's show her who's better!

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:05.390
<b>No Smoking</b>

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:05.360
An Anima is capable of climbs, 
turns, and descents exceeding 10Gs.

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:06.950
But...

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:12.690
Now Gripen is carrying an extremely 
fragile piece of luggage. You.

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:17.910
The usual limit given for humans is 9Gs.

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:26.610
Think of it like trying to 
do acrobatics while holding

00:04:26.610 --> 00:04:28.960
a spoon with a raw egg on it.

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:31.630
It's gonna limit what you 
can do, no matter what.

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:35.530
There's no way you can beat 
a solo Daughter like Eagle.

00:04:35.530 --> 00:04:39.320
So you're just going to keep 
telling Gripen to lose?

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:41.410
It's really getting to her!

00:04:41.850 --> 00:04:45.630
There's no telling what will happen if she 
goes out into a real fight like this.

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:51.850
Well, the real answer is to train your body.

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:55.610
Strengthen your muscles, 
increase your lung capacity,

00:04:55.610 --> 00:04:58.860
and train in anti-G breathing patterns.

00:04:59.720 --> 00:05:03.310
I'm lifting weights and jogging daily.

00:05:05.140 --> 00:05:08.530
But still, anything past 
10Gs is gonna be rough.

00:05:09.050 --> 00:05:13.340
And negative Gs are impossible to deal with,
 no matter how much you train.

00:05:13.340 --> 00:05:15.210
So what do we do?

00:05:21.030 --> 00:05:24.770
A way for a human and 
an Anima to fight, huh?

00:05:25.140 --> 00:05:29.340
I understand the situation. 
I'll see what I can do.

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:32.240
But I'm a little busy now.

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:35.620
To be honest, I don't have 
time to take care of Gripen.

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:39.360
I'll have to ask you to keep 
her in good mental shape.

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:41.080
You're busy?

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:44.570
You do look a little tired.

00:05:44.890 --> 00:05:47.720
I'm dealing with a lot of problems.

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:51.140
Oh... are you free tomorrow?

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:52.700
I have something to talk to you about.

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:54.790
I think I'm oka—

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:00.720
What is it?

00:06:04.020 --> 00:06:05.610
I'll be going.

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:14.050
Oh, it's Kei!

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:16.130
What are you guys doing?

00:06:16.130 --> 00:06:17.590
Physical testing.

00:06:17.590 --> 00:06:20.270
We get regular exams once a month.

00:06:20.270 --> 00:06:23.330
But all she does is mess around.

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:25.690
'Cause it's boring!

00:06:26.090 --> 00:06:28.070
You're so slow no matter what you do!

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:33.080
I was better at the side step test!

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:39.290
That boring test?

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:41.080
You took it seriously?

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:42.700
Calm down...

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:45.500
<b>New: Physical Fitness Test  Log Sheet</b>

00:06:44.350 --> 00:06:45.770
Write it down.

00:06:45.770 --> 00:06:47.330
H-Hey...

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:56.810
That doesn't count. Forget it.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:57.810
Hey!

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:09.610
<b>Please be quiet
inside the facility</b>

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:10.610
My back hurts.

00:07:11.080 --> 00:07:13.660
And my thighs and my arms...

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:16.540
You hate losing, don't you?

00:07:17.180 --> 00:07:18.540
I lose in the sky,

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:20.460
and on land, too.

00:07:21.760 --> 00:07:24.840
And then she calls me slow!

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:26.050
I can't take that.

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:28.220
I'm so mad, I could scream.

00:07:28.220 --> 00:07:30.040
It's that bad?

00:07:30.560 --> 00:07:32.310
Ow...

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:35.840
I'll do my best, so you hang in there, too.

00:07:38.280 --> 00:07:39.340
Hey, Gripen...

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:44.710
I'm glad I got to fly with you again.

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:46.180
Yeah.

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:50.860
<b>JSDF
Women's
Dorm</b>

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:52.860
I-I'll be going...

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:55.040
Why? You've come this far.

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:56.450
You can come in.

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:58.150
But this is...

00:07:58.150 --> 00:08:01.840
I'll. Show. You. A. Good. Time.

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:03.730
<i>Where did she learn that?</i>

00:08:03.730 --> 00:08:04.640
Come in...

00:08:05.240 --> 00:08:08.410
<i>How much of this situation 
does she understand?</i>

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:12.800
<i>Maybe I need to have them sit 
down and give her a talking to.</i>

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:15.640
<i>Tell her how a girl her age 
is supposed to behave,</i>

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:17.730
<i>and what things she needs 
to watch out for.</i>

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:22.610
<i>I was planning on going home after I 
walked her to her door, but this...</i>

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:25.450
<i>And it's a weekday afternoon!</i>

00:08:25.450 --> 00:08:28.560
<i>Everybody's at their stations. 
The whole place is empty!</i>

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:31.350
<i>In other words, it's just me,
 alone in her room,</i>

00:08:31.350 --> 00:08:33.230
<i>with the rooms on either side empty!</i>

00:08:33.230 --> 00:08:35.270
<i>It smells like a crime.</i>

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:39.760
No, no! I'm not going to do anything wrong!

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:41.450
But this is awkward!

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:43.840
There are lots of men who'd 
take advantage of this!

00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:51.210
I-I came inside.

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:54.290
E-Excuse me.

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:57.070
It's really clean.

00:08:57.470 --> 00:09:00.380
If I put up anything too weird,
 they get mad.

00:09:00.380 --> 00:09:01.530
Really?

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:04.560
My life here is a part of my tuning.

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:07.070
That camera there watches me constantly.

00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:09.600
It's hard to relax around that.

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:12.070
Not really. I'm used to it.

00:09:13.270 --> 00:09:14.680
What are you doing?

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:15.630
Changing.

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:17.620
The sweat feels yucky.

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:19.400
Go to the changing room or the shower room!

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:20.550
I'm right here!

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:21.410
Why?

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:24.530
Why can't I change in front of you?

00:09:24.530 --> 00:09:26.350
I-It's because...

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:29.040
B-Because you can't, okay?

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:31.350
Fine.

00:09:52.310 --> 00:09:53.560
Is that...

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:58.360
I used to have one, too.

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:04.450
<i>"Chinese Private Pilot's License Exam Prep Book"</i>

00:09:59.890 --> 00:10:02.220
But why does she have this?

00:10:02.220 --> 00:10:03.910
It's in Chinese.

00:10:05.990 --> 00:10:07.390
What's up?

00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:08.920
Did you forget something—

00:10:11.600 --> 00:10:12.970
What's wrong?

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:16.340
I-I-I-I'm leaving!

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:27.650
I'm so tired.

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:36.530
<b>Minghua</b>

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:36.530
<b>Ugh! You're so useless!!!</b>

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:36.530
<b>Sorry.</b>

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:36.530
<b>Minghua</b>

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:36.530
<b>Today</b>

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:36.530
<b>Can you buy stuff for dinner at 
the supermarket near the station?
Komatsuna spinach and ground beef.</b>

00:10:31.070 --> 00:10:34.730
<i>Can you buy stuff for dinner at 
the supermarket near the station?</i>

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:36.520
<i>Komatsuna spinach and ground beef.</i>

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:39.640
Roger.

00:10:51.160 --> 00:10:53.120
Don't ignore me.

00:10:55.790 --> 00:10:57.460
Let me go!

00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:01.470
What's going on today?

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:04.390
I said I'll show you around!

00:11:10.180 --> 00:11:11.470
Hey!

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:14.590
If you're here, you should've said something.

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:15.740
I've been looking for you.

00:11:15.740 --> 00:11:17.300
Sorry.

00:11:17.950 --> 00:11:20.470
Aw, she's with somebody already?

00:11:22.230 --> 00:11:23.950
Sorry for interrupting.

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:26.780
But you seemed like you were in trouble.

00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:29.420
No, you saved me.

00:11:29.420 --> 00:11:33.470
I don't know this area and 
didn't know what to do.

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:37.080
Okay, I'll be going.

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:41.430
I'm sorry, but how do I
 get to Komatsu Airport?

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:42.800
Komatsu Airport?

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:46.640
Yes, I'm trying to get to the JSDF base.

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:47.890
The base?

00:11:48.750 --> 00:11:53.430
The fastest way is probably to take the bus 
at Stop #5 and then get off at Ukiyanagi.

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:57.870
But it's a long way, so you 
might want to take a taxi.

00:11:57.870 --> 00:12:01.830
No, I'd rather use my own 
legs as much as possible.

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:05.500
I've been looking forward to coming 
to this town for a long time.

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:06.770
I see.

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:08.630
Anyway, be careful.

00:12:08.630 --> 00:12:10.780
Stay away from weirdos like that.

00:12:10.780 --> 00:12:13.960
All right. Thank you.

00:12:18.510 --> 00:12:20.830
What the hell's going on?

00:12:21.200 --> 00:12:23.640
How obnoxious.

00:12:23.640 --> 00:12:28.550
Maybe I should've dismantled 
his body as well.

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:35.630
Narutani Kei-san, is it?

00:12:38.990 --> 00:12:41.030
He wants you to come to Hangar 3 today.

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:43.500
Huh? Hangar 3?

00:12:50.560 --> 00:12:52.050
Hey, there you are.

00:12:52.050 --> 00:12:53.630
So this is the Phantom?

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:54.880
Surprised you knew that.

00:12:55.280 --> 00:12:57.890
The Phantom II, specifically.

00:12:57.890 --> 00:13:00.870
Modified for tactical recon.

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:04.870
You can see that extra 
tank on its belly, right?

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:07.270
That's a recon pod.

00:13:07.270 --> 00:13:08.810
This is a Daughter, right?

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:12.080
It was deployed to Misawa Base in Aomori,

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:14.690
but now we've decided to bring it here.

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:17.280
It just got here last night.

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:19.490
Then the Anima...

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:32.570
Oh.

00:13:32.570 --> 00:13:34.400
Huh? You're...

00:13:35.950 --> 00:13:37.430
Good afternoon.

00:13:37.430 --> 00:13:39.110
Thank you for your help yesterday.

00:13:39.110 --> 00:13:40.840
Oh, you know him?

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:44.720
Yes. He gave me some directions yesterday.

00:13:46.760 --> 00:13:48.040
Yes...

00:13:48.350 --> 00:13:50.640
I apologize for not introducing myself.

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:55.190
I am RF-4EJ-ANM Phantom II.

00:13:55.190 --> 00:13:57.680
Please call me "Phantom."

00:13:57.680 --> 00:13:59.530
Okay...

00:13:59.530 --> 00:14:01.060
But your hair...

00:14:01.060 --> 00:14:02.460
This?

00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:04.510
I'd dyed it yesterday.

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:07.370
I don't really like standing 
out when I'm outside.

00:14:07.370 --> 00:14:10.400
Or did you prefer it black?

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:12.280
No...

00:14:12.550 --> 00:14:14.540
Um, I'm...

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:17.340
Narutani Kei-san, right?

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:20.200
I know you well.

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:22.340
Gripen's partner.

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:24.180
I've heard about you.

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:25.070
Kei...

00:14:25.070 --> 00:14:26.460
Oh, it's Kei!

00:14:27.620 --> 00:14:29.940
Huh? An Anima?

00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:31.320
You're all here.

00:14:31.690 --> 00:14:33.390
The director's waiting.

00:14:33.700 --> 00:14:36.190
Take them to the TRDI building.

00:14:40.430 --> 00:14:43.240
So this is sudden, 
but I've got an announcement.

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:46.100
The Anima at Komatsu Base will now

00:14:46.100 --> 00:14:49.000
function as an independent unit.

00:14:49.930 --> 00:14:55.230
Your new name is the Independent Mixed 
Test Unit, or IMTU for short.

00:14:55.230 --> 00:14:56.490
IMTU...

00:14:56.490 --> 00:15:00.330
In other words, from now on, we're a team.

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:03.870
The Daughters will be brought 
together in one place

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:06.260
to increase Japan's ability 
to deal with the Xi.

00:15:06.740 --> 00:15:09.200
It's more efficient from a maintenance

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:12.680
and management perspective 
to have us all in one place.

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:14.420
But what brought this on?

00:15:14.420 --> 00:15:16.540
The attack on Komatsu.

00:15:17.230 --> 00:15:20.760
It seems to have woken up the higher-ups.

00:15:20.760 --> 00:15:25.830
A plan that had been shelved for 
a while was finally approved.

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:28.020
Who are you?

00:15:28.510 --> 00:15:32.120
I was just listening to Daddy!

00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:34.110
I'm sorry.

00:15:34.110 --> 00:15:38.080
I am RF-4EJ-ANM Phantom—

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:39.500
An F-4?

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:41.670
I didn't know any of 
those were still flying!

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:45.410
I thought they were all scrapped by now.

00:15:45.720 --> 00:15:51.250
You've got a big mouth for a child whose 
airframe is only twenty or so years old.

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:52.750
Both of you are old lad—

00:15:52.750 --> 00:15:55.730
Hey! Don't make it any worse!

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:59.370
Was your embarrassing failure 
during the defense of Komatsu

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:02.980
because you couldn't properly 
assess your enemies' capabilities?

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:06.020
Are you saying you're stronger than me?

00:16:06.020 --> 00:16:07.440
Who knows?

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:10.890
But I do think that if I'd been up there,

00:16:10.890 --> 00:16:14.270
I could've limited the damage 
our allies suffered.

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:18.120
Then let's fight and see who's stronger!

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:20.130
I'll show you what I can do!

00:16:20.130 --> 00:16:21.850
Hey, I don't think...

00:16:21.850 --> 00:16:22.860
Very well.

00:16:22.860 --> 00:16:23.990
Yashirodoori-san!

00:16:23.990 --> 00:16:28.870
Let's do some combat training 
to test out the Phantom.

00:16:29.310 --> 00:16:31.030
Gripen, you go up there, too.

00:16:31.030 --> 00:16:32.100
Me, too?

00:16:32.100 --> 00:16:34.000
I'll evaluate all three of you.

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:36.010
We start in an hour.

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:38.580
Everybody, get ready!

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:39.670
W-Wait...

00:16:39.670 --> 00:16:41.900
Okay! I'll smash you all up!

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:43.590
I'm looking forward to it.

00:16:48.850 --> 00:16:51.310
You three don't get along at all.

00:16:51.670 --> 00:16:54.340
Couldn't you be a little more cooperative?

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:56.020
Cooperative?

00:16:56.020 --> 00:16:58.790
You're all Anima. Can't you get along?

00:16:59.130 --> 00:17:02.120
You all want to defeat the Xi.

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:05.690
I don't think that set of values 
is something we were given.

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:08.930
The concept you refer to

00:17:08.930 --> 00:17:14.440
wasn't in our initial conditioning
or personality adjustment programs.

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:17.860
I am who I am. She is who she is.

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:20.490
We do our mission and save humanity.

00:17:20.490 --> 00:17:22.280
That is all.

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:25.870
<i>Barbie 03, Runway 24.</i>

00:17:25.870 --> 00:17:28.800
<i>Cleared for takeoff when ready.</i>

00:17:28.800 --> 00:17:33.280
Barbie 03, Runway 24, cleared for takeoff.

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:40.730
Barbie 02, here I go!

00:17:42.590 --> 00:17:45.540
<i>Barbie 01, cleared for takeoff.</i>

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:46.330
Kei...

00:17:46.700 --> 00:17:48.990
I'm fine. Let's go.

00:17:54.110 --> 00:17:57.640
<i>All Barbie units, 
begin the training operation.</i>

00:17:58.130 --> 00:17:59.990
<i>Time at 18.</i>

00:17:59.990 --> 00:18:02.290
Feel free to come at me two on one.

00:18:02.900 --> 00:18:05.890
I can get back to my 
maintenance faster that way.

00:18:06.860 --> 00:18:08.980
You really do make me mad, you old hag!

00:18:08.980 --> 00:18:12.480
Fine! I'll shoot you down first!

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:16.570
What do we do?

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:18.050
Join Eagle.

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:21.950
I'm worried about how 
unconcerned Phantom seems.

00:18:22.480 --> 00:18:24.790
She's going out of her way to provoke us.

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:25.940
She's got some trick up her sleeve.

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:26.990
Roger.

00:18:27.350 --> 00:18:28.750
<i>Begin mission.</i>

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:30.030
Engage.

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:32.450
I'm coming, too.

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:39.670
Fox 2!

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:44.770
Too easy!

00:18:46.420 --> 00:18:48.070
Now, it's over!

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:52.550
<i>Barbie 02, lost!</i>

00:18:53.780 --> 00:18:55.200
Gripen, break!

00:18:56.980 --> 00:18:57.910
She's behind us!

00:19:02.400 --> 00:19:03.790
Fox 2.

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:22.580
She disappeared again!

00:19:24.280 --> 00:19:25.290
No way.

00:19:28.220 --> 00:19:30.380
<i>It's over. Return to base.</i>

00:19:31.250 --> 00:19:34.440
What the hell is going on?

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:38.580
Gripen, what's wrong?

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:42.870
Something... seems weird.

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:48.130
Don't tell me that was 
your best shot, was it?

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:54.890
All that talk, and you lost so easily 
to an old fighter like me.

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:57.710
There must be some reason, right?

00:19:58.160 --> 00:20:00.610
Some reason that you couldn't 
use your full strength,

00:20:00.610 --> 00:20:03.290
and were instead shot down so pathetically.

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:06.470
Shut up! You jerk!

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:08.540
Jerk! Jerk!

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:10.770
I hate you! I hate your guts!

00:20:13.030 --> 00:20:14.900
You didn't need to say it like that.

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:22.370
The worst people in the world are 
the weak who think they're strong.

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:26.280
"I'm strong. No one can beat me."

00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:31.510
There's nothing more annoying than 
someone who's so convinced of that fact

00:20:31.510 --> 00:20:33.830
that they stop thinking 
and go out of control.

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:36.300
Are you talking about Eagle?

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:37.770
Who knows?

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:39.820
Why did you cheat?

00:20:40.140 --> 00:20:41.010
Cheat?

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:44.820
I think it's wrong to cheat in 
what should be a fair fight.

00:20:45.230 --> 00:20:47.220
What are you talking about?

00:20:48.170 --> 00:20:49.810
Hey, Gripen...

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:53.350
You inserted incorrect information 
into the data link.

00:20:54.170 --> 00:20:58.230
She cracked into the channel that 
Anima use to share information

00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:02.790
about their positions and sensor data,
 then fed us false information.

00:21:03.910 --> 00:21:08.430
Then the reason she kept disappearing 
and reappearing in that last fight...

00:21:09.070 --> 00:21:10.610
Those were fake Phantoms.

00:21:11.020 --> 00:21:13.920
She was feeding us false 
electronic information.

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:15.000
That's cheating.

00:21:16.850 --> 00:21:18.600
What of it?

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:24.680
In a real fight, you do whatever 
it takes to win, right?

00:21:24.680 --> 00:21:29.390
In a real fight, allies don't share 
false information with each other!

00:21:33.180 --> 00:21:37.270
Who is really worse to 
have as an ally, I wonder?

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:43.670
I'll be going.

00:21:44.140 --> 00:21:46.910
I'm keeping the mechanics waiting.

00:23:27.650 --> 00:23:29.970
Next time on <i>Girly Air Force</i>...

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:33.420
ALT 06: "Raison d'Etre."

00:23:30.590 --> 00:23:40.020
<i>Raison d'Etre</i>

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:37.810
Barbie 01, cleared for take off!
